{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1335339-alternate-n-day-events","id":1335339,"title":"Alternate N-Day Events","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-09-12T13:12:33-07:00","id":1335339,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon3.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Alternate N-Day Events","content":"So I may mess with things going for an alternate version of N-Day causing Novas to erupt world wide.<br /> <br /> For example a big one people mention a lot here is the CERN activation causing eruptions.<br /> <br /> What other ones would you propose and any comments on any mentioned here are welcome. Its a discussion and brainstorm thread.<br /> <br /> So I like the idea of a big mysterious Solar Flare EMPs the Earth into a big blackout, it doesn't cause the dark age but it causes a lot of devastation and probably a recession. And the catch is something caused the Quantum Solar Flare, so either secret Earther Mad Scientists/Conspiracies (like Doctor Primoris) or Aliens shoot a device at the Sun and Novas are the result, and maybe even life on Mars...<br /> <br /> Time Travel caused N-Day, either the present activating a time travel device or the Future or Past touching the present causing a Quantum Backlash.<br /> <br /> Then, of course, a secret project, maybe during World War II or earlier, activated a sleeper Gene that cause Nova eruptions after a few generations. Maybe even the first batches of Nuclear weapons bathed portions of the world in ambient Quantum that was benign at first but once those exposed to it had children with others exposed to it they became potential novas in later generations. The ambient quantum could have been more widespread than anyone imagined so maybe the Manhattan project resulted in undetectable Quantum saturation reaching from Alaska to Central America, and Japan and Bikini Atoll saturated Asia and the Pacific. This could mean Europe, Africa and South America at first has the least amount of Novas Erupting as they spread from North America and the Pacific.<br /> <br /> Other Ideas?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-12T20:38:16-07:00","id":1335409,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1335339-alternate-n-day-events#post1335339\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Maybe even the first batches of Nuclear weapons bathed portions of the world in ambient Quantum that was benign at first but once those exposed to it had children with others exposed to it they became potential novas in later generations. The ambient quantum could have been more widespread than anyone imagined so maybe the Manhattan project resulted in undetectable Quantum saturation reaching from Alaska to Central America, and Japan and Bikini Atoll saturated Asia and the Pacific. This could mean Europe, Africa and South America at first has the least amount of Novas Erupting as they spread from North America and the Pacific.</div> </div> </div> </div>That depends on when you set your game. France set off a fair few nukes in Africa during the '60's. This is worth a watch if you're at all interested in the where and when of nuclear explosions: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LLCF7vPanrY\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LLCF7vPanrY</a>.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12791,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12791-fortunatus","user":"Fortunatus","date":". 09-12-2019, 11:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12791-fortunatus","name":"Fortunatus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12791_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-12T22:08:36-07:00","id":1335419,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fortunatus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1335339-alternate-n-day-events?p=1335409#post1335409\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That depends on when you set your game. France set off a fair few nukes in Africa during the '60's. This is worth a watch if you're at all interested in the where and when of nuclear explosions: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LLCF7vPanrY\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LLCF7vPanrY</a>.</div> </div> </div> </div>My idea was only the early prototype nukes held unstable Quantum waves, and when other countries replicated it this technological aspect was absent.<br /> <br /> <br /> On a similar note the Tunguska event would be an interesting Catalyst as well.<br /> <br /> But a similar idea could be the areas furthest from the Quantum waves developed Psiads as a natural backlash mechanism.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-13T01:01:52-07:00","id":1335427,"title":"","content":"Hm, alternate trigger events is it?<br /> <br /> -One of the asteriods buzzing the planet that our current sky-sweeping tech didn't catch held a hidden payload of quantum-rich particles that seemed to burn up harmlessly in the atmosphere, but actually became a subtle dusting of quantum catalyst that bathed the world. The explosion of satellites, space-stations, or whatever else happened next was merely a coincidence.<br /> <br /> -Or perhaps the issue comes from within? After heedlessly fracking in a particular oil stratum, a condensed gas was released into the air that quickly spread through the atmosphere with what looked (at first) to be radioactive isotopes which apparently had very very short (seconds long) half-lives. In reality these condensed particles unleashed a compressed mass of quantum energy that infected the entire world over the next few weeks through aerial currents.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/765-darksol-aeternium","name":"Darksol-aeternium","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar765_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"392"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-13T05:14:27-07:00","id":1335463,"title":"","content":"Oh yeah from within.<br /> <br /> Archeologists stumble upon prehuman ruins and activate a Quantum engine cause it to explode, or a surviving prehistoric Nova causes a chain reaction of eruptions, maybe bringing down the Doyen Quantum barrier. Or perhaps the ruins are discovered in Antarctica or the ocean?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-13T08:42:36-07:00","id":1335519,"title":"","content":"I really like the idea of a science project (be it the activation of a particle accelerator or the use of a nuclear weapon) could set off N-Day. The whole finding of something mysterious underground and the activation of it also interests me. I also really like the idea that an asteroid full of Quantum-imbued materials (Quantinite, hehe, or Quantium) and energies passing by and causing N-Day. <br /> <br /> (The fact that I not only enjoy but approve of variant ideas that take N-Day out from the hands of Divis Mal is interesting t o me as I really like the character and his power levels. hehe)<br /> <br /> One of the thoughts I had was to take the whole history of the modern day is based on the presence of an Inspired past. So human presence in space is a bit more nuanced then the public knows about. That is,a number of countries have secret ground to space shuttles (maybe built on Inspired tech and so they can repair it but not replace it) and a few orbital stations of the rotating torus shape. The point of this is that there is a destroy the world organization who managed to commandeer both a former Soviet space shuttle and space station that fell to disuse with the collapse of said nation. Over the last few decades they have been working on a project that when activated would basically destroy everything. Thankfully intelligence came in informing the UN and member countries of the project and the attempt. So a multinational special forces team is dispatched to said location to stop them. Unfortunately they can't totally stop the operation but what they can do is shift the energies outputted by said machine so that instead of destroying all things it simply passes through 'harmlessly'. The operation is a success and while much is kept hush hush some information about it gets out, leading to fame for some. <br /> <br /> A few years later, 2018, and the energies unleashed by the machine interact with something on Earth which causes a massive burst of Quantum radiation that starts N-Day. <br /> <br /> Another thought for this is that when the energy wave erupts it causes the presence of Inspired upon the Earth but then a few years later it interacts with something that leads to the presence of full blown Novas. The idea that the world has low powered 'heroes' and fully super powered 'heroes' is brilliant to me. <br /> <br /> A related idea is that some or all of the player novas could have been a part of the team that was sent to the orbital installation held by the terrorists. Their presence at the event could supercharge them - which could explain why they gain powers at a much faster rate then most others and such.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-13T10:55:29-07:00","id":1335553,"title":"","content":"I can dig it, it reminds me of that episode of Cowboy Bebop where they stop the monkey virus by locking the bad guys in hyperspace so they pass through planets without interacting.<br /> <br /> I can see the event activating a number of Talents and with a boom in so many Talents there are a lot more crazy science experiments which lead to a basic super saturation of Earth from different experiments gone wrong. Basically maybe individual accidents would just cause the eruption of a single Nova or a group nearby, but they start chainreacting in the atmosphere until N-Day pops off. Or maybe they build up and build underneath the Doyen's Quantum barrier till that erupts unleashing all the Quantum at once.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-13T12:32:47-07:00","id":1335577,"title":"","content":"Hehe Aeon Aexspansion mentions archeologists discovering ruins that activate Noetic wielders, glad I posted this hours before it was released. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-13T12:44:05-07:00","id":1335582,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1335339-alternate-n-day-events?p=1335577#post1335577\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hehe Aeon Aexspansion mentions archeologists discovering ruins that activate Noetic wielders, glad I posted this hours before it was released. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>That's funny. <br /> <br /> The whole idea of an ancient artifact creating an energy wave that activate world-wide quantum or noetic potential (and probably makes Talents easier to appear as well) is interesting to me. I could even see having a sort of prologue session where a bunch of 'normal' people (OR maybe they could be 'Superiors') discover an archeological ruin under the ocean in the middle of the Atlantic. They are investigating it and while doing that they touch something that causes the N-Day energy explosion. They get supercharged into full Novas while the world sees massive amount of Nova eruptions. <br /> <br /> Oh, and of course, when they exit the temple they discover they are now on land and that all around them is a continent, the lost cotninent of Atlantis come to Earth upon the activation. <br /> <br /> (This covers both a What If? scenario and an alternate N-Day scenario, hehe)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-14T00:47:52-07:00","id":1335681,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1335339-alternate-n-day-events?p=1335553#post1335553\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I can dig it, it reminds me of that episode of Cowboy Bebop where they stop the monkey virus by locking the bad guys in hyperspace so they pass through planets without interacting.<br /> <br /> I can see the event activating a number of Talents and with a boom in so many Talents there are a lot more crazy science experiments which lead to a basic super saturation of Earth from different experiments gone wrong. Basically maybe individual accidents would just cause the eruption of a single Nova or a group nearby, but they start chainreacting in the atmosphere until N-Day pops off. Or maybe they build up and build underneath the Doyen's Quantum barrier till that erupts unleashing all the Quantum at once.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm rather partial to this idea, that the eruption of each Nova causes further eruptions in those who have the potential for it. Further, that the very presence of Novas increases the likelihood of more Novas coming into existence.<br /> <br /> This process could play out imperceptibly over time, as the presence of individual Novas steadily increase the Quantum saturation in the environment. In the Adventure! era, Novas are rare, but Stalwarts less so. Their modest output of Quantum still contributes, until full blown Novas begin to emerge, in small numbers at first. The most likely to erupt are those closest to existing Novas (or proto-Novas), their proximity causing them to develop power first. (This, incidentally, also neatly explains why superpowered beings always seem to be in close proximity to each other; the effects of Quantum make it almost inevitable).<br /> <br /> Through the 60s, 70s, and 80s, Novas start to pop up more and more, to the extent that they cease being mere rumors. But their numbers are low enough - and the Novas reclusive enough from official scrutiny or study - that the cause and mechanics of them aren't understood.<br /> <br /> Come the 21st century, and Quantum saturation reaches a tipping point. Suddenly, the background Quantum is high enough - and absorption entrenched enough over years and generations - that Novas erupt in the hundreds, and then the thousands. The more erupts, the more those eruptions cascade into other eruptions. A quantum domino effect, aided by the degree to which both the environment and population have already been primed to Quantum energies.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-15T08:04:35-07:00","id":1335891,"title":"","content":"Though all public accounts indicate that the Hammersmith Device of 1922 exploded during the event of the same name the truth is slightly different - though the machine catastrophically failed it did still exist in part. With said parts being taken by Mercer and hidden in what owuld become the deepest and most secured level of the Aeon Archives. In 2022, on the one hundredth anniversary of the Incident, the device - long forgotten about - was taken out of storage by a team of curators who decided to look over it. While th t inspection was occurring something happened, a lever was flipped, and a device long thought dead activated. Though nobody died in this activation the energy wave it sent out was much wider in scale then the previous one, and more potent too.<br /> <br /> Whether this translates to the reappearance of the Inspired but at a bit higher power level (represented by increased Experience) or a world-wide manifestation of Novas/Psiads/Talents or something else is up to the particular Storytellers. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <br /> <br /> All I know is that I think its poetic to have the Hammersmith Device be used to restart a new age.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-15T08:38:32-07:00","id":1335901,"title":"","content":"Maybe the Hammersmith Device is upgraded to turn it on rather than a switch just being flipped. Or those that discovered it think they can fix the error by using Nuclear Fission rather than the meager electricity Hammersmith used.<br /> <br /> How would the world react to Inspired being found out to be a thing? People who are like you but just better? That would make people I think go crazy, cults, supremacists, dogs hanging out with cats you name it!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-22T00:17:18-07:00","id":1337299,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1335339-alternate-n-day-events?p=1335901#post1335901\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How would the world react to Inspired being found out to be a thing? People who are like you but just better? That would make people I think go crazy, cults, supremacists, dogs hanging out with cats you name it!</div> </div> </div> </div>Mass hysteria!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-22T00:24:49-07:00","id":1337300,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1335339-alternate-n-day-events#post1335339\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Time Travel caused N-Day, either the present activating a time travel device or the Future or Past touching the present causing a Quantum Backlash.</div> </div> </div> </div>I need to reread 1602 one of these days.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-22T00:32:09-07:00","id":1337301,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1335339-alternate-n-day-events#post1335339\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For example a big one people mention a lot here is the CERN activation causing eruptions.</div> </div> </div> </div>I thought through some of the political ramifications of this at one point. The market crash gets blamed solely on N-Day panic rather than the Bush Administration, McCain hammers defense defense defense to an increasingly nervous public, while Obama\u2019s lofty optimistic rhetoric is less comforting, and McCain wins the Presidency - while Obama is still a huge international celebrity (some of you may not remember the scale of his global popularity in 2008, but it was insane) and gets tapped by the UN to head Project Utopia, which he leaves the Senate to do.<br /> <br /> I think I had McCain die in office and President Palin tried to go to war to stop hyperfusion from destroying the oil industry.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-22T06:00:34-07:00","id":1337317,"title":"","content":"Interesting so you think Obama would have kept being culturally relevant even if he lost, and that the UN would want him to lead such a major project? I am curious how the UN would handle Novas. I would imagine Obama would lean more on defense in this timeline if it was a major universal political tilt.<br /> <br /> If CERN was identified as associated with N-Day I could see a lot of organizations wanting to punish them for it.<br /> <br /> And Hyperfusion would inevitably replace the Oil Industry probably one of the big ways to control that would be some method of tying the wealth and established infrastructure of Oil into being some sort of pillar in early Fusion tech and infrastructure.<br /> <br /> Would CERN be abandoned, or we it just be closely watched and regulated? Either way it would be near impossible to stop the multiple much cheaper CERN-lites developed by super scientists around the globe.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-23T10:00:02-07:00","id":1337508,"title":"","content":"Just another thought for N-Day Events, what if something like a mutated strain of Swine or Bird Flu or something even more potent like returning Bubonic Plague was the catalyst of N-Day. So what if a Bacteria or Virus was mutated with Quantum to make them deadly and resistant resulted in some of the survivors Erupting? This could be an interesting hiccup for the world besides the eruptions is the destabilization caused by a quick worldwide plague, or at least an outbreak.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-23T23:10:26-07:00","id":1337591,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1335339-alternate-n-day-events?p=1337508#post1337508\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just another thought for N-Day Events, what if something like a mutated strain of Swine or Bird Flu or something even more potent like returning Bubonic Plague was the catalyst of N-Day. So what if a Bacteria or Virus was mutated with Quantum to make them deadly and resistant resulted in some of the survivors Erupting? This could be an interesting hiccup for the world besides the eruptions is the destabilization caused by a quick worldwide plague, or at least an outbreak.</div> </div> </div> </div>That IS interesting, as it means that a nova by definition is already exposed to your supervirus and probably carries that disease wherever they go. The usual narrative of helping humanity out suffers somewhat when the benefactors can't even interact with their supplicants. And it furthers Mal's original goal of &quot;the city on the hill&quot; where novas have to build their own settlements apart from humanity for fear of spreading the plague.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/765-darksol-aeternium","